# Direct OpenAI API via existing model-provider.ts (no separate sandbox).
# This is a template only. DO NOT place a real API key in Git, a public
# GitHub issue/PR, a chat message, or a screenshot.
# EAINESY_MODEL_BACKEND=openai-compatible
# EAINESY_MODEL_ENDPOINT=https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
# EAINESY_MODEL_NAME=gpt-4.1
# EAINESY_MODEL_API_KEY=<set only in a trusted local environment or secret store>
# Only explicitly configured server processes use this endpoint.
#
# Without these settings, EAInesy keeps the original Z.ai SDK backend.
